#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_element.rst:5
msgid "Edit element"
msgstr "编辑元素"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_element.rst:7
msgid ""
"Working with collections can only be done from the collections panel. Before"
" starting to work with collections, the collections panel has to be "
"displayed."
msgstr "合作收藏只能从收藏面板上完成，在开始合作收藏之前，必须展示收藏面板。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_element.rst:12
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display > Collections** menu item to display the "
"Collections panel."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 收藏** 菜单项以显示收藏面板。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_element.rst:14
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows editing existing element from some collection. The user "
"has only read rights at QET element collection, the user can edit already "
"existing element from all collections except QET collection element."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许编辑一些收藏中已有的元素。用户仅在 QET 元素收藏中拥有读取权限，用户可以从除 QET "
"收藏元素外的所有收藏中编辑已经存在的元素。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_element.rst:18
msgid "Right click on the element which should be edited."
msgstr "右键单击应编辑的元素。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_element.rst:23
msgid "Figure: Options at element"
msgstr "图：元素的选项"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_element.rst:25
msgid ""
"Click the option **Edit element** to open the element at the element editor."
msgstr "单击选项 **Edit 元素** 在元素编辑器上打开元素。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_element.rst:26
msgid "Make the changes desired and save them."
msgstr "做出所期望的改变并保存它们。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/edit_element.rst:30
msgid ""
"For more information about the element editor, refer to `element editor "
"<../..//element/elementeditor/index.html>`_ section."
msgstr ""
"关于元素编辑器的更多信息，请参见： `元素编辑器 <../..//element/elementeditor/index.html>`_ 节。"
